  "decision_conditions": [
    "This proposal CONSTITUTES DEVELOPMENT within the meaning of Section 55 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990, and a planning application IS REQUIRED. This is because it does not meet criteria laid down in the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 and any subsequent legislative amendments. \r\n\r\nThe scheme does not comply with E.1 (c) of Class E, Schedule 2, Part 1 of the Town and Country (General Permitted Development) Order 2015 (as amended), this is because the proposed outbuilding would be forward of what is considered to be the principal elevation.\r\n\r\nThe scheme does not comply with A.1 (b) of Class A, Schedule 2, Part 2 of the Town and Country (General Permitted Development) Order 2015 (as amended), this is because the proposed living wall would be greater than 2m above ground level."
